    "player_dependency_boundary": "UnderworldPlayer.gd BUILD_PATH/RUN_SHEET/STATES_SHEET directly read animation_build.json and the two body atlases. Bind their complete bytes as well as the script; this is an explicit actual-consumer closure, not a recursive asset scanner. Latest user adoption uses PlayerPresentationRuntime factory for real Home/Plains/Forest bodies, AvatarPresentation session selection and exact candidate motion resources above; UnderworldPlayer remains actual superclass and classic body. Motion/weapon feedback are presentation-only; audio lifecycle is separately tested. No development panels, ability grants or training targets are installed in the formal factory."
  },
  "validation": "Supplement or any shared reference SHA drift blocks new calls and resumes; versioned impact analysis/rebind and fresh affected technical/visual evidence required. Original Bible bytes and old receipts remain unchanged. Cross-region actual golden comparison is required before expanding new regional materials; metadata and hashes never sign visual acceptance.",
  "applies_to": "all_region_create_optimize_and_proposed_bibles",
  "original_bible_regions": [
    "windchime_plains",
    "thorn_forest"
  ],
  "region_scope": "Every current catalog region and later new region; the two original Bible documents are unchanged.",
